LavenderTown_Interior6_Text_MrFuji::
	.string "MR.FUJI: Welcome.\p"
	.string "Hmm... You appear to be raising\n"
	.string "your POKéMON in a kind and loving\l"
	.string "manner.\p"
	.string "POKéMON lovers come here to pay\n"
	.string "their respects to departed POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Please offer condolences for the\n"
	.string "souls of the departed POKéMON.\l"
	.string "I’m sure that will make them happy.$"

LavenderTown_Interior6_Text_OldWoman::
	.string "The POKéMON that lived with me...\p"
	.string "I loved them like my grandchildren...$"

LavenderTown_Interior6_Text_Woman2::
	.string "There are other graves of POKéMON\n"
	.string "here, I think.\p"
	.string "There are many chambers that only\n"
	.string "MR.FUJI may enter.$"

LavenderTown_Interior6_Text_Lass::
	.string "I came with my Mom to visit POKéMON\n"
	.string "graves...$"
